        "@value": "Stance of a derivation toward its source (playful, satirical, serious, reverential); its instances are SKOS concepts."
      },
      {
        "@language": "pt-BR",
        "@value": "Postura da derivação em relação à origem (lúdica, satírica, séria, reverencial); suas instâncias são conceitos SKOS."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/aro/ontology#aspectSourceSelection",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/aro/ontology#TransformationAspect"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/aro/ontology/module/derivation"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
